<title>HONG KONG: Chung Hwa raises US$7.5 mln in US spinoff.</title>
<headline>Chung Hwa raises US$7.5 mln in US spinoff.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chung Hwa Development Holdings Ltd said it had raised about US$7.5 million from the U.S. listing of its Leading Edge Packaging Inc subsidiary.</p>
<p>Shares in Leading Edge began trading on the Nasdaq national market on December 2.</p>
<p>Chung Hwa said it issued 1.25 million new shares in the previously wholly-owned unit to retail and institutional investors at US$6.00 per share.</p>
<p>It said the public offer was fully subscribed and it now holds about 60 percent of Leading Edge.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
</text>
